Rust Axum API generated by smokeforge.

## Commands

```bash
make install
# commit Cargo.lock after the first install
make run
make test
make check
make build
```

The API serves `/healthz`, `/readyz`, `/api/v1/ping`, `/openapi.json`, and
`/docs`. Read `CONTEXT.md` for engineering rules and `docs/API.md` for the
contract.
